Subject: [PATCH] usblp: poison URBs upon disconnect
Date:   Thu,  7 May 2020 10:58:06 +0200
Message-Id: <20200507085806.5793-1-oneukum@suse.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.16.4
